  m_Name: 06_GradesCalculation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MissionDefinition
  MissionId: T06
  MissionTitle: Calculating Grades
  Objective: Read a score using input(). Print Pass if the score is at least 50;
    otherwise, print Try Again.
  Hint: Use int(input()) to read a number, then use if and else.
  TestCases:
  - Input: 75
    ExpectedOutput: Pass
  - Input: 30
    ExpectedOutput: Try Again
  - Input: 50
    ExpectedOutput: Pass
